# Abstractions

- Interfaces and DTOs only; no NuGet references
- `InferenceSpec` = ONNX tensor layout (no sample rate)
- `AudioSourceInfo` = reader probe result
- `SeparationRequirements` = builder config (sample rate, stem names)
- `IAudioSeparator.CreateSession` returns `ISeparationSession`
- `IAudioWriter` exists for I/O extensions, not for the separator pipeline
